WEBVTT

00:01.777 --> 00:06.537
<i>Ever since I was a child, 
I've noticed I'm not like others.</i>

00:06.997 --> 00:11.187
<i>My father was a human, 
but my mother was an elf.</i>

00:11.617 --> 00:13.627
<i>So I was a half-elf.</i>

00:15.177 --> 00:16.897
Hey, look at that!

00:16.897 --> 00:18.687
Yeah. Such strange ears!

00:18.687 --> 00:22.827
<i>People around me treated me 
like a curiosity and stared at me.</i>

00:23.207 --> 00:24.377
<i>That's why...</i>

00:24.937 --> 00:27.157
I don't need any friends.

00:28.097 --> 00:30.727
<i>That's what I always used to think...</i>

00:33.357 --> 00:35.387
Oh wow!

00:35.677 --> 00:39.977
The atmosphere of their buildings and 
fashion are so different from our kingdom.

00:39.977 --> 00:42.737
So this is Alpheria's culture.

00:42.737 --> 00:46.127
This event is also supposed to deepen 
friendly relations with Arnold,

00:46.127 --> 00:50.107
so I suppose Alpheria is pulling out all 
the stops to make a good impression.

00:50.107 --> 00:51.657
Exactly so!

00:51.657 --> 00:54.197
Alpheria is known for 
its conservative people,

00:54.197 --> 00:56.497
and they've finally
opened up for diplomacy!

00:56.497 --> 00:59.417
This Hymn Festival will 
go down in history.

00:59.417 --> 01:01.487
Princess Olivia!

01:01.487 --> 01:03.927
It's nice to see you, ladies.

01:04.277 --> 01:06.217
It has been too long.

01:06.217 --> 01:07.257
Too long.

01:07.257 --> 01:08.727
By the way, Maria.

01:09.187 --> 01:11.297
Where's my Ray?

01:11.297 --> 01:13.017
I don't see him.

01:13.017 --> 01:14.437
Um...

01:14.437 --> 01:15.667
"My"...

01:15.667 --> 01:16.437
Ray?

01:16.437 --> 01:17.417
Maria...

01:18.947 --> 01:21.207
Do you know something about this?

01:21.937 --> 01:24.647
Um, well... we didn't come here together...

01:24.647 --> 01:25.827
I see.

01:25.827 --> 01:28.437
What is the Princess doing here?

01:28.647 --> 01:30.797
I guess if you're part of 
the top three noble houses,

01:30.797 --> 01:32.957
you even get to be 
acquaintances of the Princess.

01:32.957 --> 01:35.407
All the important people are over there.

01:35.407 --> 01:37.247
Isn't she supposed to be...

01:37.247 --> 01:38.377
H-Hey!

01:38.957 --> 01:40.147
Oh?

01:40.147 --> 01:41.207
That's...

01:42.047 --> 01:43.337
Ray?

01:43.337 --> 01:45.747
And Elisa?!

01:46.617 --> 01:49.367
What is Elisa doing over there?

01:49.367 --> 01:51.047
This person...

01:51.907 --> 01:55.247
This person is my boyfriend!

02:21.007 --> 02:23.857
What?!

02:28.497 --> 02:32.467
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

02:33.227 --> 02:37.017
<b>Episode 5
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest Sorcerer
Goes on a Date With That Girl in a Foreign Land</b>

02:38.507 --> 02:41.257
You are Alpherian royalty?

02:41.827 --> 02:44.767
I guess I'm the fourth princess.

02:44.767 --> 02:47.347
I only recently found out myself.

02:47.347 --> 02:48.267
Huh?

02:48.567 --> 02:50.277
What does that mean?

02:50.607 --> 02:54.777
My mother was Alpherian royalty.

02:55.087 --> 02:58.277
But it seems she slipped out 
of the country all the time.

02:58.547 --> 03:02.617
That's how she met my father 
and eloped with him.

03:02.617 --> 03:05.577
Your mother sounds like a firecracker.

03:05.577 --> 03:07.377
Eloping, huh?

03:07.377 --> 03:09.747
Has such a romantic ring to it.

03:08.907 --> 03:10.397
So that's what happened.

03:10.787 --> 03:14.547
But royalty or not, you are you.

03:14.547 --> 03:16.307
This doesn't change anything.

03:21.297 --> 03:25.947
We have prepared a room... for each 
of you for the duration of your stay!

03:21.307 --> 03:24.017
No, no!

03:25.947 --> 03:27.137
No fair!

03:27.137 --> 03:30.257
Yesterday, we were in the same room.

03:29.577 --> 03:32.597
Please behave yourself!

03:33.697 --> 03:38.567
I heard your friends from school 
entered the country earlier.

03:38.567 --> 03:41.367
They should be arriving 
at the assembly hall soon.

03:41.367 --> 03:42.627
Thank you.

03:46.197 --> 03:47.407
Ray.

03:48.567 --> 03:50.237
That looks great on you.

03:50.237 --> 03:53.347
You look like an elegant 
fairy in that dress.

03:54.157 --> 03:56.217
Thank you.

03:56.537 --> 03:58.397
And, um...

03:58.397 --> 03:59.457
Yes?

03:59.457 --> 04:03.587
I'm going to have to introduce myself 
to all those important people.

04:03.967 --> 04:06.527
Would you mind coming with me?

04:06.527 --> 04:08.477
You can count on me.

04:11.727 --> 04:13.917
Is that the famous Princess Elisa?

04:13.917 --> 04:15.837
Yes. Lady Saria's daughter.

04:15.837 --> 04:17.737
They say she's been in 
Arnold all this time.

04:18.687 --> 04:21.857
I'm glad you could make it, Elisa.

04:22.247 --> 04:25.057
I am King Abel Alpherius.

04:25.057 --> 04:27.007
It's a pleasure to meet you.

04:27.007 --> 04:30.777
Your mother Saria was my younger sister.

04:30.777 --> 04:33.507
Which would make me 
your uncle, I suppose.

04:33.507 --> 04:35.837
I-Is that so?

04:35.837 --> 04:38.917
And this is my younger brother Cyril.

04:38.917 --> 04:41.147
It's nice to meet you. Welcome.

04:41.147 --> 04:42.567
L-Likewise...

04:42.567 --> 04:44.287
I believe this is our first meeting.

04:44.287 --> 04:46.267
I am Crown Prince Rald.

04:46.707 --> 04:49.517
I'm honored to have gained such 
an adorable little sister.

04:49.517 --> 04:52.137
I-It's nice to meet you.

04:52.137 --> 04:53.037
Likewise.

04:53.037 --> 04:55.067
Hello, Elisa!

04:55.397 --> 04:58.227
I'm Cathy, the third princess.

04:58.227 --> 04:59.307
R-Right.

04:59.307 --> 05:00.867
It's great to meet you, Elisa!

05:00.867 --> 05:02.257
Ever since I heard I have a little sister,

05:02.257 --> 05:05.427
I've wanted to meet you
so, so, so, so much!

05:05.427 --> 05:09.037
A cute little sister 
is like a dream come true!

05:09.037 --> 05:11.547
Please call me "Big Sis."

05:11.547 --> 05:13.127
I suppose you can also 
call me "Elder Sister,"

05:13.127 --> 05:15.987
but I like it to be more casual.

05:15.987 --> 05:18.447
So how do you feel about "Big Sis?"

05:19.607 --> 05:20.937
Um...

05:20.937 --> 05:22.057
Also.

05:22.317 --> 05:24.977
Regarding the human gentleman.

05:25.587 --> 05:27.797
What is he to you?

05:27.797 --> 05:29.287
Right. I am...

05:29.287 --> 05:31.217
This person...

05:31.217 --> 05:33.807
This person is my boyfriend!

05:33.807 --> 05:35.397
Boyfriend!

05:47.437 --> 05:51.087
Right. I am her boyfriend.

05:56.587 --> 06:00.137
<i>I had clocked her as 
timid and well-behaved...</i>

06:00.137 --> 06:01.867
<i>She's not bad!</i>

06:03.987 --> 06:06.697
Wai— You...

06:08.097 --> 06:12.097
Could you repeat that one more time?

06:12.097 --> 06:13.307
Yes.

06:13.307 --> 06:15.977
Elisa and I ended up 
pretending to be a couple.

06:16.237 --> 06:19.977
Please advise me on how I 
ought to act as a boyfriend.

06:19.977 --> 06:23.997
We just arrived in 
Alpheria, and now this?

06:24.417 --> 06:25.987
What do you think, Abbie?

06:26.417 --> 06:28.037
No comment.

06:29.967 --> 06:33.997
Well, I am rich in experience 
in all manner of things...

06:33.997 --> 06:36.237
I expected nothing less, Master!

06:37.617 --> 06:40.607
Anything to add, Carla?

06:40.887 --> 06:43.887
You want to act as if you're 
in a relationship with Elisa.

06:43.887 --> 06:45.627
Is that correct?

06:45.867 --> 06:46.837
Yes.

06:48.107 --> 06:50.157
I'm so sorry about earlier!

06:50.157 --> 06:52.267
I don't mind.

06:52.267 --> 06:54.387
But what happened?

06:54.387 --> 07:00.477
It just felt like everyone was 
treating me like some sort of object.

07:00.477 --> 07:01.967
I got scared...

07:02.997 --> 07:07.177
For Elisa's sake, I want to play the 
role of her boyfriend perfectly!

07:07.177 --> 07:08.557
Understood.

07:08.557 --> 07:12.947
What level of courtship 
are you envisioning?

07:12.947 --> 07:14.767
What was the reason for 
you two getting close?

07:14.767 --> 07:17.387
What does Elisa like to do on dates?

07:17.387 --> 07:18.657
I'm sorry.

07:18.657 --> 07:20.657
I haven't thought about that at all.

07:20.657 --> 07:22.027
I see.

07:22.027 --> 07:25.497
You will need a lot of coaching.

07:25.497 --> 07:26.927
Thank you for your guidance.

07:26.927 --> 07:28.077
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

07:28.077 --> 07:31.427
<i>Carla is highly skilled in 
the ways of... romance?!</i>

07:31.427 --> 07:33.887
We will begin with the basics.

07:33.887 --> 07:34.757
Yes, ma'am!

07:37.277 --> 07:40.177
Wasn't expecting that.

07:40.177 --> 07:41.947
Who would've thought you and Elisa...

07:41.947 --> 07:43.957
When did it even start?

07:44.157 --> 07:45.457
I'm sorry.

07:45.457 --> 07:47.447
I cannot give you details.

07:48.337 --> 07:52.357
Well, regardless of the circumstances,
we are on your side.

07:52.357 --> 07:53.207
That's right!

07:53.437 --> 07:54.777
You guys...

07:55.197 --> 07:56.487
Well then...

07:56.487 --> 07:57.707
...it's time.

07:57.707 --> 07:59.247
You're already getting out?

07:59.247 --> 08:01.677
If we don't get that report...

08:01.677 --> 08:03.347
It's training time! Training!

08:04.897 --> 08:07.017
Right, training.

08:07.017 --> 08:08.137
See ya, Ray!

08:08.137 --> 08:09.917
Oh, sure...

08:17.707 --> 08:20.977
So you are Ray White?

08:21.247 --> 08:24.487
Yes. And you are...

08:24.487 --> 08:27.727
Marius Bassett.

08:27.947 --> 08:29.257
Marius...

08:30.627 --> 08:32.647
The Sorcerer of Phosphorescence.

08:32.647 --> 08:35.157
It's nice to meet you, Iceblade.

08:36.357 --> 08:39.967
I will be staying here for a while.

08:39.967 --> 08:42.247
If anything happens, please let me know.

08:42.247 --> 08:45.177
Um, thank you very much.

08:46.817 --> 08:49.387
I will go now.

08:53.287 --> 08:54.897
The hot water got to his head.

08:59.767 --> 09:00.897
Everyone...

09:00.897 --> 09:02.507
Wh-What a coincidence.

09:02.507 --> 09:05.177
We were just taking a walk.

09:05.177 --> 09:06.267
Oh?

09:06.267 --> 09:10.927
So, um, how do you feel about...

09:10.927 --> 09:12.167
About?

09:12.167 --> 09:14.897
Even if you "cannot give details..."

09:14.897 --> 09:18.267
What is your stance on 
dating and romance?!

09:22.697 --> 09:24.117
I don't know.

09:25.027 --> 09:27.597
I've learned a lot from Carla,

09:27.597 --> 09:29.807
but I still don't have a 
good sense of it myself.

09:29.807 --> 09:31.817
Oh, I see!

09:31.817 --> 09:33.807
So that's what happened.

09:34.627 --> 09:36.977
I-It's nothing.

09:36.977 --> 09:40.557
We just wanted to be on the safe side.

09:42.157 --> 09:44.127
<i>Romance, huh?</i>

09:44.127 --> 09:46.067
<i>I wonder how Elisa feels.</i>

09:50.087 --> 09:51.247
Yamo.

09:52.137 --> 09:55.617
Ray, this is your room for tonight.

09:55.967 --> 09:56.817
Good night.

10:00.147 --> 10:02.147
I'll sleep on the floor.

10:02.147 --> 10:06.427
I guess this is because 
we're supposed to be a couple.

10:06.427 --> 10:07.827
But I...

10:08.857 --> 10:12.337
I don't mind it!

10:15.427 --> 10:17.297
Ray, are you awake?

10:18.547 --> 10:19.547
Yes.

10:20.167 --> 10:23.237
Once again, let me apologize.

10:23.237 --> 10:24.817
You don't have to worry about it.

10:24.817 --> 10:26.207
But...

10:26.207 --> 10:28.097
We're friends.

10:28.097 --> 10:30.487
If you need my help, you can ask any time.

10:31.687 --> 10:35.687
And then, I'd like to hear words 
of gratitude instead of an apology.

10:35.987 --> 10:37.317
Gratitude?

10:37.317 --> 10:38.207
Yes.

10:38.207 --> 10:40.197
There's nothing to feel guilty about.

10:40.607 --> 10:42.707
So you can just say thank you.

10:42.707 --> 10:43.957
That's enough.

10:44.537 --> 10:48.387
Uh, Ray. Thank you.

10:48.387 --> 10:49.297
You're welcome.

10:50.057 --> 10:53.727
Who would've thought Elisa was 
the fourth princess?

10:54.027 --> 10:55.967
Did you know too, Abbie?

10:55.967 --> 10:57.567
More or less.

10:57.567 --> 10:59.347
I am the principal, after all.

10:59.347 --> 11:01.217
Our amazing principal!

11:01.217 --> 11:06.807
But the timing of the summons makes me 
wonder if there's some hidden plan.

11:07.727 --> 11:09.717
Right.

11:09.717 --> 11:12.727
But that girl doesn't have it easy.

11:13.187 --> 11:16.397
I mean, she has to
really face herself now.

11:19.327 --> 11:21.897
Elisa, please wake up.

11:21.897 --> 11:22.987
Elisa.

11:28.257 --> 11:31.407
Good morning, Ray.

11:31.407 --> 11:33.157
Good morning.

11:33.677 --> 11:37.657
You should probably close 
the buttons over your chest.

11:43.667 --> 11:45.277
The weather is gorgeous.

11:45.277 --> 11:47.527
Elisa, let's go on a date.

11:47.527 --> 11:49.067
<i>Ba-dump!</i>

11:49.067 --> 11:53.027
<i>Dump... dump... dump...</i>

11:53.557 --> 11:54.427
Here.

11:56.337 --> 11:59.787
We are supposed to be a couple.

11:59.787 --> 12:03.957
And couples naturally hold hands 
when they are walking outside...

12:03.957 --> 12:05.277
supposedly.

12:05.677 --> 12:07.907
A date means holding hands.

12:07.907 --> 12:09.997
Escort her skillfully.

12:10.577 --> 12:12.817
Perhaps you don't want to?

12:12.817 --> 12:13.547
What?

12:13.547 --> 12:15.577
No!

12:16.567 --> 12:19.057
Well then, excuse me!

12:22.207 --> 12:23.497
Yay!

12:23.497 --> 12:24.437
Toury!

12:24.437 --> 12:25.697
What, Sugari?

12:25.697 --> 12:27.057
I love you!

12:27.057 --> 12:28.097
I love you too!

12:28.097 --> 12:29.877
Yay!

12:35.757 --> 12:39.587
A gentleman must also take care 
to adjust his gait to the lady's.

12:43.867 --> 12:48.427
At times, showing off your physical 
prowess is also important.

12:51.207 --> 12:56.427
Doing so allows your partner to 
feel at ease and relax on the date.

13:01.097 --> 13:02.767
What strange flowers!

13:02.767 --> 13:04.667
I've seen these in a 
reference book before,

13:04.667 --> 13:07.197
but this is my first time 
seeing them in real life.

13:07.197 --> 13:08.767
It's the Princess!

13:08.767 --> 13:09.977
It is!

13:10.347 --> 13:11.947
Princess!

13:12.367 --> 13:13.747
Wow, she's so pretty.

13:13.747 --> 13:14.897
So lovely.

13:15.467 --> 13:18.197
Looks like even these 
kids know who you are.

13:18.197 --> 13:19.627
Um...

13:19.627 --> 13:22.607
You two are a couple, aren't you?

13:23.827 --> 13:27.137
Come on, spill the beans. 
How far have you gone?

13:27.137 --> 13:28.447
How far?!

13:28.877 --> 13:30.647
Holding hands?!

13:30.977 --> 13:32.577
Sharing a bed?

13:33.377 --> 13:35.257
<i>Sharing a bed?!</i>

13:34.527 --> 13:36.437
And then!

13:36.437 --> 13:37.777
Kissing?

13:37.777 --> 13:38.887
And stuff?

13:38.887 --> 13:41.157
K-Ki...

13:41.157 --> 13:42.127
Elisa!

13:42.127 --> 13:43.177
Are you okay?

13:43.937 --> 13:45.727
Please excuse us.

13:46.587 --> 13:48.727
Princess Elisa is tired.

13:48.727 --> 13:50.397
We must go now.

13:50.397 --> 13:51.897
Okay.

13:54.297 --> 13:55.397
Feast your eyes.

13:55.397 --> 13:58.127
That's a true princess carry.

13:58.127 --> 13:59.197
For sure!

13:59.197 --> 14:00.347
<i>I see.</i>

14:00.347 --> 14:03.337
<i>Elves are older than they look.</i>

14:03.777 --> 14:07.467
<i>{this anything?}</i>

14:09.757 --> 14:11.567
Ray?

14:11.947 --> 14:13.377
Have you recovered?

14:14.287 --> 14:16.597
I'm so sorry! I...

14:16.597 --> 14:17.727
Don't worry about it.

14:20.437 --> 14:24.717
But it's not easy, is it?

14:24.717 --> 14:27.407
Behaving like we're a couple.

14:28.847 --> 14:31.487
Yeah... You're right.

14:36.057 --> 14:37.287
Elisa?

14:37.287 --> 14:38.317
Ray!

14:39.437 --> 14:41.557
May I practice more?

14:43.607 --> 14:44.567
Yes.

14:43.937 --> 14:46.307
Stop right there.

14:47.427 --> 14:49.547
Third Princess Cathy?

14:50.817 --> 14:54.327
You're Elisa's boyfriend, right?

14:54.327 --> 14:55.997
Yes, I am.

14:55.997 --> 14:58.577
How dare you be so brazen?!

14:58.847 --> 15:00.417
I saw you yesterday!

15:00.417 --> 15:03.537
Having fun with a group of human girls!

15:03.537 --> 15:04.887
A cheater! A cheater!

15:04.887 --> 15:05.977
Unfaithful!

15:06.537 --> 15:07.827
Unfaithful! Unfaithful!

15:07.827 --> 15:09.347
Freaking cheater!

15:09.347 --> 15:11.037
You cheater!

15:10.197 --> 15:12.217
Cheater!

15:12.217 --> 15:13.347
Oh!

15:13.347 --> 15:15.427
Those are my good friends.

15:15.427 --> 15:17.037
There is no cheating at all.

15:17.037 --> 15:21.407
I've been happy ever since 
I heard I had a little sister.

15:21.407 --> 15:25.117
I swore that I'd take care of her, 
no matter what, no matter where.

15:25.117 --> 15:29.537
Going out together, dressing her in 
pretty clothes, brushing her lovely hair.

15:29.537 --> 15:31.577
How nice to be able to 
do those things! How sweet!

15:31.577 --> 15:36.677
I said I would do everything for her and 
make her fall in love with Alpheria!

15:36.677 --> 15:38.267
So, why, then?!

15:38.267 --> 15:41.747
Why would she have a human boyfriend?!

15:42.247 --> 15:45.337
Even then, I tried everything 
I could to understand it.

15:45.337 --> 15:49.867
I said, since Elisa picked him, 
he couldn't be such a terrible guy.

15:50.267 --> 15:52.247
But I see that was all wrong!

15:52.247 --> 15:53.927
You womanizer!

15:53.927 --> 15:56.307
Princess Cathy, 
that expression is unbecoming.

15:56.307 --> 15:57.547
Is that so?

15:57.547 --> 15:58.657
It really is.

15:59.757 --> 16:02.487
You philanderer! May you 
sink into a hell of oil!

16:03.587 --> 16:06.407
You really are not worthy of my trust.

16:06.407 --> 16:09.857
It is crystal clear that your heart 
does not beat for Elisa alone!

16:09.857 --> 16:11.407
Um, Princess Ca...

16:11.407 --> 16:12.767
That is not true!

16:13.147 --> 16:16.237
I love Elisa with all my heart!

16:19.087 --> 16:20.177
Elisa?

16:20.177 --> 16:21.707
Elisa, are you okay?

16:21.707 --> 16:22.997
You're all talk!

16:22.997 --> 16:26.877
But if you pass a trial of mine

16:25.247 --> 16:26.317
Elisa!

16:26.877 --> 16:29.207
then, let's say, I could come to accept it.

16:29.207 --> 16:30.167
Maybe.

16:30.817 --> 16:32.597
A trial?

16:32.597 --> 16:33.437
That's right.

16:33.437 --> 16:38.457
One of the most dangerous places 
in Alpheria is the Parade Forest.

16:38.457 --> 16:42.267
Bring me a mandrake from that forest!

16:42.267 --> 16:43.687
That's all?

16:43.687 --> 16:44.717
Hmph.

16:44.717 --> 16:48.437
Even among elves, this is considered 
to be the most difficult trial!

16:48.437 --> 16:49.937
And <i>why</i> is that?!

16:49.937 --> 16:52.117
When you pull the mandrake 
from the soil...

16:52.117 --> 16:53.977
The mandrake lets out a hideous scream!

16:53.977 --> 16:55.757
Anyone who sees it will 
faint and be in great pain.

16:55.757 --> 16:58.167
At any rate, it is a very bad time!

16:58.167 --> 17:00.577
What say you? 
Terrifying, is it not?

17:00.797 --> 17:04.537
I'm fully aware how 
impossible this task is.

17:04.537 --> 17:08.267
But I won't accept anything less than 
the power to protect Alpherian royalty!

17:08.267 --> 17:12.177
So you are welcome to cry, apologize, 
and break it off with Elisa.

17:11.457 --> 17:12.627
I accept.

17:13.587 --> 17:16.597
I will go harvest a mandrake.

17:16.847 --> 17:20.607
I'll begin preparations right away 
and leave early tomorrow morning.

17:20.927 --> 17:22.617
Is there a time limit?

17:23.697 --> 17:27.867
Umm... Until dusk... I guess?

17:28.057 --> 17:29.257
Understood.

17:29.627 --> 17:30.757
I promise to bring it back.

17:35.537 --> 17:37.367
I'm sorry, Mia.

17:37.367 --> 17:40.617
I'll be preparing here 
tonight for tomorrow.

17:40.617 --> 17:42.737
Please look after Elisa.

17:42.737 --> 17:45.247
Indeed. I'll take care of her.

17:47.197 --> 17:49.247
I'm alone again.

17:55.757 --> 17:57.497
Claris?

17:57.497 --> 17:58.907
Oops. Here I am.

18:00.027 --> 18:05.537
So that's why Ray is taking 
on your older sister's trial.

18:05.537 --> 18:08.607
Yeah. It was already decided
when I woke up.

18:08.607 --> 18:10.637
Woke up from what?

18:10.637 --> 18:13.527
Um, err, I mean, I was 
looking elsewhere just then!

18:14.507 --> 18:19.417
Since I've come here, 
everything's been so much to take in.

18:20.727 --> 18:25.297
And then I ended up involving Ray
and causing him problems.

18:25.297 --> 18:27.797
I don't know what to do.

18:27.797 --> 18:29.987
I wouldn't worry about it.

18:29.987 --> 18:32.357
It's Ray, so he'll be fine 
no matter what happens.

18:32.357 --> 18:33.377
But...

18:35.047 --> 18:36.347
Elisa?

18:36.347 --> 18:37.887
Is someone in there with you?

18:37.887 --> 18:40.397
No! I'm talking to myself.

18:40.397 --> 18:41.487
All right.

18:41.487 --> 18:44.657
Would you like to take 
dinner in your room?

18:44.657 --> 18:46.697
I'll come down to eat.

18:46.697 --> 18:47.947
As you wish.

18:47.947 --> 18:49.547
Then I will go prepare.

18:47.947 --> 18:49.267
I should go.

18:49.547 --> 18:51.267
Thank you!

18:50.537 --> 18:51.807
See you tomorrow.

18:52.317 --> 18:53.827
Tomorrow?

18:53.827 --> 18:55.817
Does that mean you're coming too?

18:56.577 --> 18:58.637
Isn't that what friends do?

19:11.037 --> 19:12.017
All right!

19:26.487 --> 19:30.747
I thought he sensed us, 
but it looks like we're okay.

19:31.127 --> 19:35.647
So that place is in the back here, huh?

19:35.647 --> 19:37.567
Well, that doesn't matter to me.

19:37.567 --> 19:39.657
I won't interfere.

19:39.657 --> 19:42.157
Just do your part without messing up.

19:44.587 --> 19:47.157
Why are you not saying anything?

19:47.157 --> 19:50.857
Flashing your eyes like that! 
You're too focused on looks!

19:50.857 --> 19:52.157
Sheesh!

19:54.217 --> 19:57.167
The forest is extra aggressive today.

19:57.167 --> 20:00.907
There's no way he'll bring a mandrake 
back in these conditions.

20:00.907 --> 20:03.947
But did he really go in there?

20:03.947 --> 20:04.667
Yes.

20:04.667 --> 20:06.677
It's confirmed that he entered the forest.

20:06.677 --> 20:08.777
<i>Is he going to be okay?</i>

20:08.777 --> 20:10.047
Ray...

20:10.047 --> 20:11.147
What now?

20:11.147 --> 20:12.227
Don't worry.

20:12.227 --> 20:13.387
It's Ray!

20:15.757 --> 20:17.187
Look over there!

20:19.557 --> 20:20.707
Ray!

20:20.707 --> 20:22.067
Ray!

20:22.547 --> 20:23.697
Ray!

20:23.947 --> 20:25.267
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

20:26.227 --> 20:28.707
I knew you'd give up and come back.

20:29.017 --> 20:31.047
Well, that's very sensible of you.

20:31.047 --> 20:32.677
No, I got it.

20:32.677 --> 20:33.457
What?

20:33.457 --> 20:36.037
How did you do that in such a short time?

20:36.037 --> 20:38.767
I just went over there and came back.

20:38.767 --> 20:40.077
You "just"?

20:40.077 --> 20:41.017
Yes.

20:41.017 --> 20:43.227
Hey, now... It's heavy!

20:44.417 --> 20:46.807
That's not possible.

20:50.357 --> 20:53.567
You must've just taken some 
grass from around there.

20:54.217 --> 20:56.177
Yeah, look at...

20:56.177 --> 20:56.887
Huh?

21:01.487 --> 21:02.767
Princess Cathy!

21:02.187 --> 21:03.327
Cathy!

21:03.327 --> 21:04.587
Princess Cathy!

21:06.067 --> 21:08.207
I can see the light!

21:11.177 --> 21:15.087
Thank you all for coming.

21:15.087 --> 21:17.197
<i>Why are we using my room for this?</i>

21:17.197 --> 21:18.097
Well, then.

21:18.097 --> 21:21.327
How does everyone feel about 
the current state of affairs?

21:21.327 --> 21:24.807
I think it's very... bad.

21:24.807 --> 21:27.587
Indeed. This is an extremely 
grave situation.

21:27.997 --> 21:32.597
I do not mind if this continues as-is and 
Ray's romantic feelings awaken in him.

21:32.927 --> 21:33.957
However!

21:33.957 --> 21:38.157
Should Elisa be right there in 
front of him when it happens...

21:38.157 --> 21:42.117
That would be ultra 
intensely seriously bad!

21:42.427 --> 21:44.967
In the sense of love imprinting!

21:46.907 --> 21:49.367
Love imprinting?!

21:50.397 --> 21:52.377
But what can we do?

21:52.377 --> 21:54.627
We still have many options.

21:54.947 --> 21:59.187
I've got Claris assessing 
the current situation.

22:00.127 --> 22:02.377
I heard everything.

22:02.677 --> 22:06.567
So this means you're 
all my rivals in love.

22:09.947 --> 22:13.417
You see, I was running an 
investigation on my own!

22:15.587 --> 22:18.217
How about we cooperate?

22:20.737 --> 22:25.907
Anyway, I can't acknowledge your 
abilities with the mandrake alone.

22:25.907 --> 22:27.467
That's right! That's right!

22:27.467 --> 22:28.927
Meaning?

22:28.927 --> 22:32.907
That going forward, I will be 
observing you myself from up close.

22:32.907 --> 22:34.227
This is your next trial.

22:35.047 --> 22:36.247
Understood.

22:36.247 --> 22:37.647
Laugh it up...

22:37.647 --> 22:38.927
...while you can!

22:38.927 --> 22:40.537
Will he be okay?

22:40.537 --> 22:42.177
Let's believe in him.

22:45.537 --> 22:47.927
Why don't you try fishing, then?

22:48.367 --> 22:49.327
Fishing complete!

22:49.327 --> 22:50.427
That's a lot!

22:50.427 --> 22:52.927
But are you any good at preparing them?

22:53.317 --> 22:54.867
Grilled to perfection!

22:55.177 --> 22:57.287
I'll be the judge of that.

22:58.237 --> 23:00.057
That is so good...!

22:59.357 --> 23:01.197
The amount of salt is exquisite!

23:01.197 --> 23:02.957
We're old!

23:02.227 --> 23:05.187
Let's see you mingle with 
the old people around here!

23:05.187 --> 23:06.087
Mate.

23:06.697 --> 23:08.387
You got me.

23:10.607 --> 23:11.947
Not bad...

23:12.177 --> 23:13.527
Are we done now?

23:13.527 --> 23:15.957
Not yet, not yet, not yet!

23:17.067 --> 23:18.887
I folded everything.

23:18.887 --> 23:20.707
I also finished cleaning.

23:20.707 --> 23:21.907
Ray!

23:21.907 --> 23:23.307
Wow, Ray!

23:23.307 --> 23:24.627
Im...possible...

23:24.627 --> 23:26.467
I can't believe he's perfect 
at cleaning and laundry too...

23:27.977 --> 23:30.027
<i>Not a fault to be found!</i>

23:30.027 --> 23:34.437
<i>None... none... none... none... none...</i>

23:48.777 --> 23:52.107
I am Cathy Alpherius, 
Elisa's adorable older sister.

23:48.787 --> 23:55.587
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.787 --> 23:55.587
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:52.107 --> 23:53.817
You're so wise and 
wonderful, Princess Cathy!

23:53.817 --> 23:54.677
I'm Elisa.

23:54.677 --> 23:55.577
I'm Claris.

23:55.577 --> 23:57.427
Don't think that you've won this.

23:56.637 --> 23:58.427
This is far from over. Here we go!

23:57.427 --> 23:58.127
Um, uh...

23:58.417 --> 23:58.877
Hello?!

24:03.037 --> 24:03.537
Next time on

24:03.537 --> 24:05.247
<i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World</i>

24:05.247 --> 24:06.617
<i>Two</i>!

24:05.267 --> 24:09.057
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:06.967 --> 24:09.047
We'll keep on going in episode 6!

24:09.047 --> 24:11.467
The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer...

24:09.057 --> 24:15.047
<b>Episode 6
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest
Sorcerer Faces the Incoming Trials</b>

24:11.467 --> 24:13.357
Faces the Incoming Trials!
